<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.13 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.13 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction January 21 versus January 14:</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    82/89     173/180	 357/364</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   2.96/2.99  3.02/3.08     3.19/3.25</p>
<p> Highest yld     2.96/2.99  3.02/3.08     3.20/3.26</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     2.95/2.97  3.02/3.07     3.16/3.25</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   815/1,075  120/495	 193/740</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    835/2,585  270/625	 213/940</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 40,017 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
